  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" class=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"increase\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Increase count by one\">+1</button>\n      <button id=\"decrease\" class=\"btn\" aria-label=\"Decrease count by one\">-1</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" class=\"btn reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with count output and three labeled buttons."
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2a2d45;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --btn: #5d5c8a;\n  --btn-hover: #7b7ab0;\n  --btn-active: #4a4970;\n  --focus: #ffcd75;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 1rem;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  line-height: 1;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n  background: var(--btn);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 3.5rem;\n  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--btn-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  background: var(--btn-active);\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n\n.reset {\n  background: #8a5d5d;\n}\n\n.reset:hover {\n  background: #b07b7b;\n}\n\n.reset:active {\n  background: #704a4a;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  .card {\n    padding: 1.5rem 1rem;\n  }\n  .count {\n    font-size: 3rem;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;\n    min-width: 3rem;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style theme with cohesive palette, responsive layout, focus/hover/active states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n  var increaseBtn = document.getElementById('increase');\n  var decreaseBtn = document.getElementById('decrease');\n  var resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n\n  var count = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    countEl.textContent = String(count);\n  }\n\n  increaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  decreaseBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();",
      "description": "Counter logic with addEventListener, supports negative numbers, no storage."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nA simple offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No dependencies, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Features\n\n- Initial value of 0\n- Increase (+1), decrease (-1), and reset to 0\n- Supports negative numbers\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout from 360px wide\n- Pixel-inspired theme with a cohesive palette\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click the buttons or use Tab to focus and Enter/Space to activate.\n\n## File Structure\n\n- `index.html` — markup and button IDs\n- `styles.css` — pixel-style theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — counter logic\n- `README.md` — this file\n\n## Constraints\n\n- No external assets, iframes, or server code\n- Total source under 200 lines\n- Buttons labeled for accessibility\n- Output element ID `count` shows only the integer",
      "description": "Project documentation with usage and file structure."
    }
  ]
